      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.29,
      "end_seconds": 233.91,
      "duration_seconds": 18.62,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest. I smoke, yes, around five a day. I share a flat with two friends. I'm retired now, I was a clerk for years"
