      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.26,
      "end_seconds": 282.78,
      "duration_seconds": 26.52,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like benign extra heartbeats, though we should confirm. I'll request an ECG, it'll help with palpitations. Try cutting out caffeine for two weeks and see if the beats settle. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Come back in four weeks."
    },
